<odoo><template id="contract_invoice_deductions" inherit_id="account.report_invoice_document"><xpath expr="//div[@id='payment_term']" position="before"><div t-if="o.cra_enabled or o.cra_advance_id or o.cra_movement_ids" class="mt-3 mb-3" style="page-break-inside: avoid;"><h5>Retention &amp; Advance Recovery</h5><table class="table table-sm"><tbody><tr><td>Eligible completed work</td><td class="text-end"><span t-field="o.cra_base"/></td></tr><tr><td>Untaxed subtotal</td><td class="text-end"><span t-field="o.amount_untaxed"/></td></tr><tr><td>Tax / VAT</td><td class="text-end"><span t-field="o.amount_tax"/></td></tr><tr><td>Gross invoice total</td><td class="text-end"><span t-field="o.amount_total"/></td></tr><tr><td>Retention (<span t-field="o.cra_retention_percent"/>%)</td><td class="text-end"><span t-field="o.cra_retention"/></td></tr><tr><td>Advance recovery <span t-if="o.cra_recovery_method == 'percent'">(<span t-field="o.cra_recovery_percent"/>%)</span><span t-else="">(fixed)</span><br/><small t-if="o.cra_advance_id"><span t-field="o.cra_advance_id.payment_id.name"/></small></td><td class="text-end"><span t-field="o.cra_recovery"/></td></tr><tr class="fw-bold"><td>Immediate payable before cash payments</td><td class="text-end"><span t-field="o.cra_payable"/></td></tr><tr t-if="o.cra_handover_date"><td>Expected retention handover</td><td class="text-end"><span t-field="o.cra_handover_date"/></td></tr></tbody></table><small>Gross invoice and VAT are unchanged. The standard Amount Due reflects reconciliations and cash payments. Retention becomes collectible when explicitly released.</small></div></xpath></template></odoo>
